# Evidence receipts hash *committed bytes*, and the Windows runners check text out with
# core.autocrlf=true: an unpinned LF file arrives as CRLF and every digest in the receipt stops
# matching. B10 hit exactly that -- net8.0/net10.0 windows-latest failed on the discovery suite
# (run 42744015517) while every Linux job stayed green, because only a CRLF checkout can show
# it. The per-batch lines above were the fix one batch at a time; this pins the whole evidence
# tree so the next batch cannot forget, and tests/discovery/test_census.py asserts the pin holds
# for any file a receipt hashes.
docs/research/evidence/**/*.json text eol=lf
